      "sourceObservations": "Observed mechanisms supplied by the user: case:carbon-layers uses context-aware nested surface, field, and border roles; its four-layer system may be too heavy here. case:smarthr-color-roles separates semantic color responsibilities. These mechanisms do not establish how many layers Mimic needs.",
